  2. Create agent:   pcli create demo   (uses default template: claudecodeui)
  3. List agents:    pcli list
  4. Deploy workload: pcli run demo

GLOBAL FLAGS (any subcommand):
  --on-behalf-of <user>  Act on <user>'s agent instead of your own
  --owner <user>         Alias for --on-behalf-of
  (also: env vars PCLI_ON_BEHALF_OF, PCLI_IR_TICKET, PCLI_IR_REASON)

  Requires ti-plf-palana-ir or ti-plf-palana-admin group membership.
